======= ADD OP /    MON =======

---- ../bfdctl -C bfdd.sock -M -a

you must specify a remote peer or label

---- ../bfdctl -C bfdd.sock -M -a -m

you must specify a remote peer when using any of -i/-l/-m

---- ../bfdctl -C bfdd.sock -M -a -m -p 127.0.0.2

